      "name": "Pelagodroma",
      "rank": "GENUS",
      "description": "A monotypic genus of storm petrel with extraordinarily long legs that trail well beyond the tail in flight. The White-faced Storm Petrel has a distinctive appearance with a white face and dark eyestripe, resembling a tiny shearwater.",
