      "id": "GENUS_NESOFREGETTA",
      "name": "Nesofregetta",
      "rank": "GENUS",
      "description": "A monotypic genus of large, strikingly patterned storm petrel found in the tropical Pacific Ocean. It is the largest storm petrel in the Southern Ocean and has a distinctive white collar and breast band.",
